{"id":"c4da698d5dde6a6d","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-arithmetization-pr.md","title":"Arithmetization Yields PR Relations","display":"lem-arithmetization-pr — Arithmetization Yields PR Relations","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-arithmetization-pr","aliases":["92-lem-arithmetization-pr"],"display":"lem-arithmetization-pr — Arithmetization Yields PR Relations","depends_on":["[[92-df-arithmetization-property]]","[[92-df-pr-predicate]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]"],"source":"第 III 章 pp. 30–36（PDF 47–53）","source_status":"本地 PR 算术化补充"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-arithmetization-pr"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-arithmetization-pr</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-arithmetization-pr — Arithmetization Yields PR Relations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4875a0c262fafe7c\" href=\"?note=4875a0c262fafe7c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-property\">92-df-arithmetization-property</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"298d80fabfd2a708\" href=\"?note=298d80fabfd2a708\" title=\"92-df-pr-predicate\">92-df-pr-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 III 章 pp. 30–36（PDF 47–53）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"本地 PR 算术化补充"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k\">\\(R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k\\)</span> (arity and syntactic relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R^{\\#}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\">\\(R^{\\#}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k\\)</span> (componentwise Gödel-code image of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (fixed Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRArith}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{PRArith}_G\\)</span> (arithmetization-property predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4875a0c262fafe7c\" href=\"?note=4875a0c262fafe7c\" title=\"92-df-arithmetization-property\">92-df-arithmetization-property</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PRPred}\">\\(\\mathrm{PRPred}\\)</span> (primitive-recursive relation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"298d80fabfd2a708\" href=\"?note=298d80fabfd2a708\" title=\"92-df-pr-predicate\">92-df-pr-predicate</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}arithmetization\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\nR\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k,\\qquad\nR^{\\#}\\coloneqq\\{(\\ulcorner s_1\\urcorner,\\ldots,\\ulcorner s_k\\urcorner)\\mid(s_1,\\ldots,s_k)\\in R\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{PRArith}_G(R)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PRPred}(R^{\\#}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}arithmetization\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\nR\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k,\\qquad\nR^{\\#}\\coloneqq\\{(\\ulcorner s_1\\urcorner,\\ldots,\\ulcorner s_k\\urcorner)\\mid(s_1,\\ldots,s_k)\\in R\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{PRArith}_G(R)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PRPred}(R^{\\#}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>具有算术化性质的语法关系，其逐分量编码像是PR关系</li>\n<li>结论不是对任意语法关系无条件成立；只有另证其码关系为 PR 的语法关系才满足该前提</li>\n<li>对公式码、句子码或证明码的具体应用，仍需分别证明其解析与验证算法是 PR；本引理不替这些证明提供无条件结论</li>\n<li>关键技术结果</li>\n<li>使Prov predicate可在PA中定义</li>\n<li>Gödel证明的核心步骤</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>原书证明具体语法关系是 Arithmetic，后续进一步归类为构造算术关系。此处 PRArith 是本地性质，不能从任意关系的可判定性推出 PR；存在总递归而非 PR 的特征函数。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 III 章 pp. 30–36（PDF 47–53）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-property","status":"resolved","id":"4875a0c262fafe7c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-arithmetization-property]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pr-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"298d80fabfd2a708","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pr-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner$ (fixed Gödel numbering, see [[92-df-godel-numbering]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-arithmetization-property","status":"resolved","id":"4875a0c262fafe7c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PRArith}_G$ (arithmetization-property predicate, see [[92-df-arithmetization-property]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pr-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"298d80fabfd2a708","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PRPred}$ (primitive-recursive relation predicate, see [[92-df-pr-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k","display":false},{"tex":"R^{\\#}\\subseteq\\mathbb N^k","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRArith}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PRPred}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}arithmetization\\text{-}pr}\\vdash\nR\\subseteq\\mathrm{Expr}(\\Sigma_G)^k,\\qquad\nR^{\\#}\\coloneqq\\{(\\ulcorner s_1\\urcorner,\\ldots,\\ulcorner s_k\\urcorner)\\mid(s_1,\\ldots,s_k)\\in R\\},\n\\qquad\\mathrm{PRArith}_G(R)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{PRPred}(R^{\\#}).","display":true}],"bytes":1976,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-226","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-lem-arithmetization-pr]]"}],"outgoing":["4875a0c262fafe7c","298d80fabfd2a708","2413c1d0ca8a0ce6"]}